OL,4,CFairy trail 'too much' to manage due   
OL,5,Cto vandalism                           
OL,6,GA vandal-hit family attraction is set  
OL,7,Gto wind down after its founder said it 
OL,8,Gwas becoming "too much" to manage.     
OL,10,FThe Foss Fairy Trail was created by    
OL,11,Fvolunteers in York during the Covid-19 
OL,12,Fpandemic, to provide something         
OL,13,Fpositive for the community.            
OL,15,FHowever, over the years, founder Tracy 
OL,16,FOstle estimated there had been about   
OL,17,F150 reported incidents of vandalism    
OL,18,Fand anti-social behaviour on the trail.
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
