OL,4,CHistoric building to undergo #626,000  
OL,5,Crenovation                             
OL,6,GA council is spending #626,000 to      
OL,7,Gconserve its historic building.        
OL,9,FCity of Lincoln Council said it was    
OL,10,Frepairing the Grade I listed Stonebow  
OL,11,Fand Guildhall "to address defects      
OL,12,Fwithin the building" discovered in a   
OL,13,Fstructural investigation.              
OL,15,FIt houses the council's meeting        
OL,16,Fchamber and has been the seat of local 
OL,17,Fgovernment since the medieval period.  
OL,19,FThe current building on the city's     
OL,20,FHigh Street incorporates an archway    
OL,21,Fand dates back to the early 1500s,     
OL,22,Faccording to the Visit Lincoln webG4/4 
